[stage2A] per-factor floor: permute each factor's own vector entries across the 4,907 matched gene coordinates, 20000 times, seed 20260914. The 18,578 unmatched ruler coordinates are structurally fixed at 0 by the conversion rule and are not permuted into; this keeps every null direction inside the same measured subspace as the real effect and preserves ||d|| exactly.
